{"ID":"20260901150003-g0klx7j","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260901150003-g0klx7j","title":"实习内容","type":"doc","updated":"20261005212640"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260901150003-gu6iy82","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260901150003-gu6iy82","updated":"20260912161958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"windbg-MCP服务"}]},{"ID":"20260906103658-jmoq4et","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906103658-jmoq4et","updated":"20260906103706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整体部署架构图"}]},{"ID":"20260906103655-m20o34b","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260906103655-m20o34b","updated":"20260906103655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"graph LR\n    ai[\"AI 客户端\u003cbr/\u003eCursor / Claude / CodeBuddy\u003cbr/\u003e通过 MCP 调用调试工具\"]\n    script[\"自动化脚本\u003cbr/\u003e通过 REST API 调用\"]\n    browser[\"浏览器用户\u003cbr/\u003e打开轻量调试页面\"]\n    uploader[\"curl / HTTP 客户端\u003cbr/\u003e上传大文件\"]\n\n    server[\"CDB Analysis Server\u003cbr/\u003e单进程 ASGI 服务\u003cbr/\u003eStarlette + FastMCP + Uvicorn\"]\n\n    mcp[\"/mcp\u003cbr/\u003eMCP Streamable HTTP 入口\u003cbr/\u003e给 AI 工具调用\"]\n    api[\"/api/*\u003cbr/\u003eREST JSON 接口\u003cbr/\u003e给脚本和网页调用\"]\n    web[\"/cdb\u003cbr/\u003eWeb 调试页面\u003cbr/\u003e给人工用户使用\"]\n    upload[\"/uploads/{token}\u003cbr/\u003e一次性上传入口\u003cbr/\u003e接收 dump 和 symbol 文件\"]\n    status[\"/status\u003cbr/\u003e服务状态查询入口\"]\n\n    cdb[\"cdb.exe\u003cbr/\u003eWindows 调试器命令行程序\"]\n    symstore[\"symstore.exe\u003cbr/\u003e符号索引工具\"]\n    disk[\"data_dir 数据目录\u003cbr/\u003edumps / user_pdbs / pdb_cache / tmp\"]\n\n    ai --\u003e mcp\n    script --\u003e api\n    browser --\u003e web\n    uploader --\u003e upload\n    mcp --\u003e server\n    api --\u003e server\n    web --\u003e server\n    upload --\u003e server\n    status --\u003e server\n    server --\u003e cdb\n    server --\u003e symstore\n    server --\u003e disk"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260911101824-9in49o9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911101824-9in49o9","updated":"20260911122612"}},{"ID":"20260906103710-ym735ul","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260906103710-ym735ul","updated":"20260912161958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代码分层架构图"}]},{"ID":"20260906103734-hxi5exa","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260906103734-hxi5exa","updated":"20260906103734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"graph TB\n    entry[\"Entry 入口层\u003cbr/\u003emain.py（应用组装和启动）\u003cbr/\u003e__main__.py（python -m 入口）\"]\n\n    tools[\"Tools MCP 工具层\u003cbr/\u003etools/upload_tools.py（上传和查询工具）\u003cbr/\u003etools/cdb_tools.py（一次性 CDB 执行工具）\u003cbr/\u003etools/session_tools.py（交互式会话工具）\"]\n\n    api[\"API HTTP 接口层\u003cbr/\u003eapi/rest_api.py（REST JSON 接口）\u003cbr/\u003eapi/upload_endpoint.py（大文件上传接口）\u003cbr/\u003eapi/cdb_web.py（网页调试界面）\u003cbr/\u003eapi/auth.py（Bearer Token 鉴权中间件）\"]\n\n    core[\"Core 核心引擎层\u003cbr/\u003ecore/file_manager.py（文件和符号管理）\u003cbr/\u003ecore/session_manager.py（CDB 会话池管理）\u003cbr/\u003ecore/cdb_session.py（单个 CDB 子进程封装）\u003cbr/\u003ecore/output_parser.py（输出结构化解析）\u003cbr/\u003ecore/output_filter.py（输出清洗和截断）\u003cbr/\u003ecore/presets.py（预置分析组合）\"]\n\n    config[\"Config 配置层\u003cbr/\u003econfig.py（配置读取、目录派生、全局配置）\"]\n\n    external[\"外部程序和磁盘\u003cbr/\u003ecdb.exe（CDB 调试器）\u003cbr/\u003esymstore.exe（符号索引）\u003cbr/\u003edata_dir（dump 和符号缓存目录）\"]\n\n    entry --\u003e tools\n    entry --\u003e api\n    entry --\u003e core\n    entry --\u003e config\n    tools --\u003e core\n    tools --\u003e config\n    api --\u003e tools\n    api --\u003e core\n    api --\u003e config\n    core --\u003e config\n    core --\u003e external"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260912161958-upa7gjf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260912161958-upa7gjf","updated":"20260928195147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"介绍一下项目整体架构，从客户端到服务端的调用流程是怎样的？"}]},{"ID":"20260911124945-ibm7osa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911124945-ibm7osa","updated":"20260912161815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"入口层"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是 main.py，它负责把所有东西组装起来——创建 Starlette 应用、注册路由、配置 MCP server、启动 Uvicorn，相当于整个服务的\"总装配线\"。"}]},{"ID":"20260911124945-72nfqk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911124945-72nfqk5","updated":"20260917083257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"往下是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"接口层"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，同时暴露了两套接口：一套是 REST API，给脚本和自动化流程用的，走普通的 HTTP JSON 请求；另一套是 MCP 协议，给 AI agent 用的，走 JSON-RPC。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"两套接口功能一样，底层调的是同一套业务逻辑，只是入口不同。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260911124945-ncykqpv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911124945-ncykqpv","updated":"20260917083317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再往下是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" Tools 工具层"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这一层负责把核心功能包装成一个个独立的工具函数"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，比如上传、创建会话、执行命令\n接口层（无论是 REST 还是 MCP）收到请求后，参数校验完就转发给 Tools 层，Tools 层做业务编排，比如上传工具里拼 URL、会话工具里展开预置命令。"}]},{"ID":"20260928194604-38azvux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260928194604-38azvux","updated":"20260928194605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"--"}]},{"ID":"20260928194542-botrjia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260928194542-botrjia","updated":"20260928195147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（函数签名就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"函数名、参数名、参数类型、参数描述"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\nFastMCP 会直接读取这个函数签名，\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"自动生成 MCP 需要的 JSON Schema"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不用我们手动写。\n这个 Schema 会交给 AI 客户端，\n告诉 AI 这个工具叫什么、需要传哪些参数、参数是什么类型。）"}]},{"ID":"20260911124945-6m648dn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911124945-6m648dn","updated":"20260917083525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最底下是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"Core 核心引擎层"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这是真正干活的地方。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"file_manager 管文件存储和去重"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"session_manager 管会话生命周期和并发控制"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，cdb_session 管单个 CDB 调试进程的管道交互。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"Core 层通过 subprocess 调用外部的 cdb.exe 和 symstore.exe"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n同时从 Config 层读取所有配置参数——端口、路径、超时这些，其他层不直接读环境变量，都统一走 Config"}]},{"ID":"20260911124945-qfmrnd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911124945-qfmrnd0","updated":"20260911124945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"调用关系是单向逐层依赖的：入口层组装一切，接口层接收请求转发给 Tools 层，Tools 层编排逻辑调 Core 层，Core 层执行业务读 Config、调外部程序。每一层只调它下一层，不跨层，这样职责清晰，改任何一层不影响其他层。"}]},{"ID":"20260912161942-aaw6bct","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260912161942-aaw6bct","updated":"20260912162032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"ZGFydA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"main.py (入口层)\n  ├── REST API + MCP (接口层)\n  │     ├── auth.py (认证)\n  │     └── Tools (工具层)\n  │           ├── upload_tools\n  │           ├── cdb_tools\n  │           └── session_tools\n  └── Core (核心引擎层)\n        ├── file_manager\n        ├── session_manager\n        ├── cdb_session\n        └── Config (配置层)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260906104944-lg39vey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906104944-lg39vey","updated":"20260906105136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"函数调用关系"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n三条主链："}]},{"ID":"20260906104944-uqv23i6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906104944-uqv23i6","updated":"20260906104944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AI 调试链 → main.py → /mcp → session_tools → session_manager（转线程池）→ cdb_session → cdb.exe，输出回流经 output_filter/output_parser/presets 处理后返回\n文件上传链 → upload_tools（发 token）→ upload_endpoint（流式落盘）→ file_manager（算 SHA1 归档，必要时起线程调 symstore.exe）\n脚本/浏览器链 → rest_api 或 cdb_web → 直接复用 tools/*.py → 回到链 1 或链 2\n依赖规则（单向无环）： Entry 依赖全部 → Tools/API 依赖 Core + Config → Core 只依赖 Config + 标准库 → Config 无内部依赖，Core 从不反向引用上层。"}]},{"ID":"20260902113937-88916oy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260902113937-88916oy","updated":"20260917083913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ASGI"}]},{"ID":"20260902113947-kd09530","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902113947-kd09530","updated":"20260911125616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"ASGI是Python里Web服务器和Web应用之间的异步接口标准"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n它的前辈WSGI是2003年定的同步标准，一个请求进来就调一次你的函数，函数返回完整响应就结束。\n这个模型在当年够用，但是有两个致命短板：一次只能处理一个请求（靠多线程/多进程堆并发）\n天生不支持长连接---websocket、SSE、HTTP流式响应这些都做不了，ASGI就是为了解决这两点而生的。"}]},{"ID":"20260902114812-0lam8ud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902114812-0lam8ud","updated":"20260902120814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"ASGI的核心模型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nASGI不再是掉一次函数拿返回值，而是一个可调用对象被调用一次，拿到三个东西"}]},{"ID":"20260902120812-q7zrucg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120812-q7zrucg","updated":"20260911125628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当一个请求过来，服务器调用我们异步应用的时候，会传入三个对象：scope、receive 和 send\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"scope 存放本次连接一开始的基础信息，像请求路径、协议类型\nreceive 用来持续接收客户端后续发来的数据\nsend 可以多次向客户端推送响应"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260902120812-w94m9r6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120812-w94m9r6","updated":"20260911125634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最关键的一点就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"一次调用应用，就可以收发多次消息，连接不用马上断开"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n正是依靠这个能力，ASGI 原生支持 WebSocket 双向通信、SSE 推送还有 HTTP 流式响应这类长连接场景"}]},{"ID":"20260902120812-vpum19b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120812-vpum19b","updated":"20260917083754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再加上它基于 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"async 异步函数运行在事件循环上"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，遇到 IO 阻塞的时候可以让出资源去处理别的请求\n所以单进程就能实现很高的并发，相比多线程并发，切换开销也要小很多"}]},{"ID":"20260902120911-wko944w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120911-wko944w","updated":"20260902120938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"项目中为什么用"}]},{"ID":"20260902120937-h8ddj5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120937-h8ddj5j","updated":"20260917083818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ASGI 不只支持 HTTP，通过 scope 的 type 字段可以区分 http、websocket、lifespan 三种连接\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"其中 lifespan 是应用生命周期钩子，可以在服务启停时做资源初始化与回收工作"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，WSGI 并不具备这个能力"}]},{"ID":"20260902120937-qwkyg7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120937-qwkyg7c","updated":"20260902121108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Uvicorn 是 ASGI 服务器，负责监听端口、驱动事件循环\nStarlette 是 ASGI 应用框架，提供路由、中间件；ASGI 就是两者之间的接口契约"}]},{"ID":"20260902120937-m2y0w7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120937-m2y0w7r","updated":"20260917083913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们项目选用 ASGI 是业务场景决定的\n接口需要流式响应、大文件分片上传，还需要生命周期管理常驻进程，这些需求用同步方案很难实现\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"同时 ASGI 更适合 IO 密集场景，CPU 或者阻塞任务不能直接跑在协程里，我们会用线程池执行阻塞调用，避免卡住事件循环"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260902101300-uhf7one","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260902101300-uhf7one","updated":"20260929125703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Starlette（ASGI 框架）"}]},{"ID":"20260902101313-njz9z3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902101313-njz9z3q","updated":"20260929125703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Starlette是Python里一个很轻的异步Web框架，跑在ASGI上，只负责三件最基础的事：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"路由分发、中间件、把HTTP请求响应包装成python对象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n参数校验、API文档、依赖注入它统统不管。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"而FastAPI就是Starlette加上Pydantic校验和自动生成Swagger文档那一层便利"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260902125437-nhe3zff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902125437-nhe3zff","updated":"20260902125504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目中这套 REST的形态决定了用不上 FastAPI的核心价值\n每个端点入参就dump_sha1、commands、timeout这几个标量字\n段，全是用isinstance 加手写的_as_list、_json_error做校验\n没有任何复杂嵌套schema—Pydantic的价值在 schema 复杂、要复用、要给前端生成类型定义的时候才明显，我们这种规模用它反而把代码写长了\n自动OpenAPI文档同理，调用方是同一仓库里的JS，没有\"开放 API给人看 swagger\"的需求"}]},{"ID":"20260902125743-4yladh5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902125743-4yladh5","updated":"20260911125908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"项目用到了 FastMCP，它里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"code text","TextMarkTextContent":"streamable_http_app()"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​返回的，本身就是一个 Starlette 的子应用\n一开始我们过用 Mount 的方式挂载这个子应用，但是踩了一个坑\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"Starlette 挂载路由的时候，如果访问"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"code text","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不带末尾斜杠，它就会返回 307 重定向，跳转到"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"code text","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp/"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"\n而 MCP 客户端发送 POST 请求的时候，并不会自动跟随这个重定向，接口直接调用失败"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260902125743-cozg0u6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902125743-cozg0u6","updated":"20260911125908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以我们换了方案，直接把子应用里面的路由列表摘出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，手动合并到我们主应用当中，避开重定向问题\n这种直接读取框架内部路由、手动拼装的操作，也正是 Starlette 这种底层轻量框架比较方便做到的\n这个属于硬性要求，和是不是 REST 接口没有关系"}]},{"ID":"20260902125743-gtud4x6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902125743-gtud4x6","updated":"20260911125916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"另外我们整个项目属于重度 IO 场景，包含大文件流式落盘、CDB 子进程管理、MCP 流式收发，整条链路都是异步实现，ASGI 架构刚好完美适配这类业务。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260911130501-xvvoq1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911130501-xvvoq1z","updated":"20260911130501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在这个项目里，Starlette/ASGI 就是一个HTTP 传输管道，负责收发请求和路由，具体来说就两个用途："}]},{"ID":"20260911130501-do8n9m2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260911130501-do8n9m2","updated":"20260911130509"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260911130501-3mxbhm2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260911130501-3mxbhm2","updated":"20260911130509"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260911130501-y5p6i26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911130501-y5p6i26","updated":"20260911130509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"MCP 通信的载体"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260911130501-ud666em","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911130501-ud666em","updated":"20260917084204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"FastMCP 内部创建了一个 Starlette app，注册了 /mcp 路由"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n客户端的 JSON-RPC 请求进来，Starlette 接收、解析、路由到 MCP handler，处理完再把响应传回去\n没有 Starlette，MCP 协议就没有 HTTP 传输层可用"}]},{"ID":"20260911130501-0incat3","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260911130501-0incat3","updated":"20260911130511"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260911130501-oo6vjf4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260911130501-oo6vjf4","updated":"20260911130511"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260911130501-1ejc6zl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911130501-1ejc6zl","updated":"20260911130511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"文件上传的 HTTP 端点"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260911130501-1kl5iiy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911130501-1kl5iiy","updated":"20260911130501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"/uploads/{token} 这个路由直接挂在 Starlette app 上，接收客户端 PUT 过来的文件流。这是一个纯业务功能，跟 MCP 协议无关，但因为 MCP 已经搭了 Starlette 这个 HTTP 框架，顺便就挂在同一个 app 上了，不用额外起一个服务。"}]},{"ID":"20260911130501-u1gk8hi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911130501-u1gk8hi","updated":"20260911130501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以 Starlette 在这里的角色就是：一个轻量 HTTP 服务器，让 MCP 通信和文件上传走同一个端口。它不做 Web 页面渲染、不做数"}]},{"ID":"20260912150045-o9ulb26","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260912150045-o9ulb26","updated":"20261005212640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCPserver这个项目是做什么的？"}]},{"ID":"20260912150111-y98jfsd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260912150111-y98jfsd","updated":"20260917084421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基于 Python 的远程 Windows Crash Dump 分析服务\n服务端部署在一台装了 Windows CDB调试器的机器上，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"对外同时提供 MCP、REST API 和 Web 三种访问方式"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n用户只需要把 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".dmp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 崩溃转储文件传上来\n服务端就通过 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"code text","TextMarkTextContent":"FileManager"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 做流式落盘和 SHA1 去重\n再由 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"code text","TextMarkTextContent":"SessionManager"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 启动并维护常驻的 CDB 调试进程\n执行 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!analyze -v"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"kb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!heap -s"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 这些调试命令\nCDB 的原始输出会经过 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"output_filter"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 清洗、​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"output_parser"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 和 preset 解析成"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"结构化的 JSON"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n最后配合"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"code text","TextMarkTextContent":"MetadataStore"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 和 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"code text","TextMarkTextContent":"DiskCleaner"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 做访问元数据、过期 dump 清理和 LRU 淘汰\n让服务长期跑也不会把磁盘撑爆"}]},{"ID":"20260917084716-4h6pvy8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260917084716-4h6pvy8","updated":"20260929123049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCP server的并发处理怎么做的"}]},{"ID":"20260917084730-l7qayfq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260917084730-l7qayfq","updated":"20260921092021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个服务是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"单进程单事件循环"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，只在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"外面套了一个专门跑 CDB 的线程池"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n用的是标准库 concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor"}]},{"ID":"20260929122954-ucsq0dv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260929122954-ucsq0dv","updated":"20260929122954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"--"}]},{"ID":"20260917084730-5b9s81a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260917084730-5b9s81a","updated":"20260929123049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"具体来说，SessionManager "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"自带一个线程池，大小正好等于会话上限 15"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n所有会卡住的 CDB 命令，不管常驻会话还是 one-shot，都 run_in_executor 丢进去\nawait 一下就把 loop 让出来，所以多个客户端能真并行\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"每个会话对应一个 cdb.exe 子进程加一个读线程，阻塞在那儿拉 stdout"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"symstore.exe 用全局锁串行，同一时刻只跑一个"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260929122959-n3i4lij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260929122959-n3i4lij","updated":"20260929123000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"--"}]},{"ID":"20260917084730-a2n0xny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260917084730-a2n0xny","updated":"20260917084905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"命令怎么对上号？靠一个 Event 加一把 Lock"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n发命令前先 clear，往 stdin 里塞一对 UUID 标记把命令夹住，最后再塞个完成标记\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"读线程扫到标记就 set 唤醒工作线程，工作线程拿同一个 UUID 切片，输出就不会串"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n另外还有个协程每 60 秒回收空闲会话"}]},{"ID":"20260929123002-ieudq7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260929123002-ieudq7f","updated":"20260929123002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"--"}]},{"ID":"20260917084730-nomw7w4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260917084730-nomw7w4","updated":"20260921091700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"亮点是并发度被显式钉死在 15，不会无限制起进程\n缺点是 create_session 和上传收尾这些重活还留在 loop 上，\n同一个会话内部也缺一把串行锁，这是我觉得最该补的两处。"}]},{"ID":"20260921092824-ieqi0w0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260921092824-ieqi0w0","updated":"20260929130503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCP server的进程间通信怎么做的"}]},{"ID":"20260921092852-xizsesq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260921092852-xizsesq","updated":"20260921092939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"Python 主进程和 CDB 子进程之间的管道通信"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n启动 CDB 时用 subprocess.Popen 把它的 stdin 和 stdout 都设成 PIPE，\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"父进程往 stdin 写命令、从 stdout 读结果"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，形成一个双向通道；\nstderr=STDOUT 让报错也并进同一条流统一收。"}]},{"ID":"20260921092852-2jmv1st","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260921092852-2jmv1st","updated":"20260921093039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"另外进程内线程之间用 Lock 保护输出缓冲区、用 Event 做完成信号；\n调 symstore.exe 装符号也是同样的子进程管道方式。\n对客户端则是 HTTP/MCP，那属于网络层了。"}]},{"ID":"20260929130503-64n7xlm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260929130503-64n7xlm","updated":"20261005195713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCP都有哪些工具"}]},{"ID":"20260929130510-7xfe4hd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260929130510-7xfe4hd","updated":"20260929130753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"tool_upload — 获取上传 URL（dump/symbol，符号自动 symstore 索引）\ntool_import_from_url — 服务器直接从 URL 下载文件（symbol 同步索引）\ntool_query — 查询状态（dump 列表、会话详情、符号缓存、服务器信息）\ntool_execute_cdb — 一次性执行 CDB 命令（跑完即退，每次新进程）\ntool_create_session — 创建交互式 CDB 会话（进程常驻，可预取符号）\ntool_session_exec — 会话内执行命令/预设（支持 8 个结构化 JSON 预设）\ntool_close_session — 关闭会话释放资源"}]},{"ID":"20261005195713-bbmcu4x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261005195713-bbmcu4x","updated":"20261005200038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AI如何发现并调用你的MCP工具"}]},{"ID":"20261005195753-2esa499","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261005195753-2esa499","updated":"20261005195929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCP Server 是基于 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"FastMCP"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 搭的，工具发现走的是 MCP 协议的标准机制。\n服务端启动时用 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"@mcp.tool()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 装饰成工具函数，\nFastMCP 会自动根据每个工具函数的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"函数名"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"参数类型标注"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"文档注释"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生成对应的工具名称、功能说明和入参结构描述"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n不用我们手写那套 JSON 格式的参数定义"}]},{"ID":"20261005195753-8ulzanf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261005195753-8ulzanf","updated":"20261005200038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"AI 客户端连上来时，先发一个标准的 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"code text","TextMarkTextContent":"tools/list"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 请求"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n服务端就把这份工具清单（含参数 schema）返回给它，\n客户端据此就知道有哪些工具、怎么传参；实际调用时再发 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tools/call"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。\n传输上我们用的是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Streamable HTTP"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，端点挂在 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，\n客户端通过 HTTP POST 用 JSON-RPC 交换 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tools/list"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"tools/call"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 这些消息。"}]},{"ID":"20260912150542-heicyoy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260912150542-heicyoy","updated":"20261005203937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"FileManager都做什么了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260912151002-2xpobhq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260912151002-2xpobhq","updated":"20261005203937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"FileManager是项目的文件管理核心，主要负责"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"dump文件和符号文件的存储、去重和管理"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n具体来说，它做了四件事：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"两步上传："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先创建token和临时目录，客户端上传文件到临时目录；\n边上传边计算SHA1哈希值，然后移动到dumps/{sha1}.dmp目录，实现"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"内容寻址存储"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n这样相同内容的dump文件只会存储一份。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"token"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是服务器的\"记事本钥匙\"——\n第一次请求拿地址时服务器记下\"这个上传是dump类型\"\n第二次传完文件时通过token查记录，就知道该怎么处理\n没有token，两次请求就断了联系，服务器不知道文件是谁传的、该干嘛\npdb的流程是：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用户上传PDB--\u0026gt;存到user_pdbs/{sha1}/---\u0026gt;后台调symstore.exe把它索引到pdb_cache/ ---\u0026gt;CDB运行时读取符号"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260912152936-yyvdpkq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260912152936-yyvdpkq","updated":"20260912154227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"符号文件管理"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：用户上传的PDB符号文件会存放到user_pdbs/{dump_sha1}/目录，每个dump有独立的符号目录。\n同时会启动后台线程运行symstore.exe进行符号索引。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"并发控制"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：用类级的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"_symstore_lock锁"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来串行化所有symstore.exe调用，因为符号索引器不能并行运行"}]},{"ID":"20260912152337-klrq9l9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260912152337-klrq9l9","updated":"20260912152508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好处：\n自动去重：通过SHA1哈希，相同内容的文件只存一份，节省磁盘空间\n快速查找：基于哈希的文件名可以直接定位文件，无需遍历目录\n符号隔离：每个dump的符号独立存放，避免冲突\n并发安全：通过锁机制确保符号索引操作的安全执行"}]},{"ID":"20260911110418-egs9s5j","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260911110418-egs9s5j","updated":"20260929124753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服务解dump时PDB符号是怎么获取的"}]},{"ID":"20260911110524-fvlsxa0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911110524-fvlsxa0","updated":"20260912152925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"服务有一个三级符号查找机制。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n当 CDB 加载 dump 需要某个模块的 PDB 时"}]},{"ID":"20260911111121-4krutfc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911111121-4krutfc","updated":"20260929124753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"CDB 加载 dump 时，会自动扫描所有模块的 PE 头，\n提取出每个模块的 PDB 文件名 + GUID + Age，\n然后拿着这组信息去符号服务器查询：\"有没有一个 GUID 和 Age 都匹配的 PDB？\""},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260911111121-a4qog87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911111121-a4qog87","updated":"20260912152925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"会按优先级依次查找：\n第一优先级是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"本地缓存目录 pdb_cache"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果之前分析过同一个模块，PDB 已经缓存在本地就直接用；\n第二优先级是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"企微内网符号服务器 \\9.134.15.240\\foxmail\\Symbols"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，通过 SMB 网络协议按需拉取企微自己编译的 PDB；"}]},{"ID":"20260911110649-ht2f8j6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911110649-ht2f8j6","updated":"20260912152925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果前两级都没有，最后兜底去"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"微软公共符号服务器拉取系统模块的 PDB"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260911110653-xwm1gn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911110653-xwm1gn0","updated":"20260912152925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉取下来的 PDB 会自动缓存到本地 pdb_cache 目录，下次再遇到同一个模块就不用重复下载了\n所以这个目录一开始是空的，随着分析的 dump 越多，缓存的 PDB 会逐渐积累"}]},{"ID":"20260911110524-vn3euju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911110524-vn3euju","updated":"20260912152925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"另外，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用户也可以主动上传私有 PDB 文件，上传后会通过 symstore.exe 索引进本地符号仓库"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n而且我们把用户私有符号目录插到符号路径最前面，保证私有 PDB 优先于公共符号命中，不会被覆盖掉\n创建会话时还可以设 prefetch_symbols 参数，让 CDB 在后台提前把所有模块的符号都下载好\n后续分析命令执行时就不用等符号加载了"}]},{"ID":"20260912155052-o63dg2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260912155052-o63dg2u","updated":"20260912155109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong te