":"NodeText","Data":"：用ThreadPoolExecutor把阻塞的CDB调用桥接到线程池，避免阻塞事件循环\n\t\t(用asyncio.get_event_loop().run_in_executor()\n\t\t把同步阻塞调用扔到ThreadPoolExecutor的线程里执行\n\t\t主线程继续处理其他请求)\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"空闲清理"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：后台协程每分钟扫描，自动关闭空闲超过30分钟的会话\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"符号预取"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：后台线程执行.reload/f预加载符号，避免阻塞主线程\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一次性执行"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：支持one-shot模式，执行完命令后立即关闭CDB进程"}]},{"ID":"20260912160857-8j1o2ze","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260912160857-8j1o2ze","updated":"20260921102134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));"},"TextMarkType":"code text","TextMarkTextContent":"MetadataStore"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 和 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));"},"TextMarkType":"code text","TextMarkTextContent":"DiskCleaner"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​都做什么了（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"元数据和磁盘清理"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"}]},{"ID":"20260912161257-2apvwtx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260912161257-2apvwtx","updated":"20260912161259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"MetadataStore：dump文件的访问元数据管理器"}]},{"ID":"20260912161257-mwyt3y5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260912161257-mwyt3y5","updated":"20260912161302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"记录每个dump的上传时间、最后访问时间、访问次数、文件大小\n线程安全（threading.Lock保护）\n延迟写策略：每10次变更或每60秒才写一次磁盘，减少高频IO\n提供LRU列表（按最后访问时间排序）和过期列表（超过N天未访问）"}]},{"ID":"20260912161304-nhhqxtd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260912161304-nhhqxtd","updated":"20260912161304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"DiskCleaner：磁盘自动清理引擎"}]},{"ID":"20260912161257-cpvwbzu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260912161257-cpvwbzu","updated":"20260912161607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"定时清理：每天清理tmp目录的残留文件\n过期清理：每月清理超过保留天数的dump文件（至少保留N个最新的）\n磁盘水位淘汰：当磁盘使用率超过阈值（如80%），按LRU顺序删除dump直到降到目标水位（如70%）\n（启动后60秒执行第一次清理      之后每24小时执行一次）\n定时任务：用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"asyncio.create_task()创建后台协程，内部用asyncio.sleep()循环定时"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"执行清理逻\n安全保护：跳过正在被CDB会话使用的dump"}]},{"ID":"20260902164204-98ckhhu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260902164204-98ckhhu","updated":"20260911131515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个项目自己负责的部分有哪些？有没有借鉴一些开源项目？"}]},{"ID":"20260905221212-3j8x7u8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260905221212-3j8x7u8","updated":"20260905221227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"借鉴了 GitHub 上 svnscha/mcp-windbg 这个开源项目\n但只借鉴了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"底层的 CDB 子进程通信机制"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，上层业务逻辑和工程化架构都是自己写的。"}]},{"ID":"20260905221212-3sjrmsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260905221212-3sjrmsj","updated":"20260905221732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"借鉴的部分：\n原项目使用 Python 的 subprocess.Popen启动 cdb.exe，用 stdin/stdout 管道交互；\n因为 cdb 的输出是流式的，主线程直接读取容易阻塞，所以专门开了一个后台线程持续读取输出内容并缓存。\n每次执行命令后会附加输出一段自定义标记，线程识别到该标记就判定命令执行完成，拿到完整输出结果。\n这个 marker 模式是整个项目的地基。\n同时参考了它用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"FastMCP 注册 MCP 工具"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的写法。\n但原项目功能很有限，本质就是命令透传——AI 发什么 CDB 命令就直接丢给进程，输出原样返回，没有结构化解析、没有文件管理、没有 Web 界面、没有会话池。"}]},{"ID":"20260905221212-owzkxql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260905221212-owzkxql","updated":"20260905222550"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自己写的部分：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"改造为 UUID 成对边界标记​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"===CMD_BOUNDARY_{uuid}_START/END==="},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，每条命令分配唯一 ID，实现输出严格隔离。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"写了 7 个正则解析函数，配套 7 个 preset，\nAI 传入 preset 名就能拿到结构化 JSON，不用啃 CDB 原始文本。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"文件管理模块实现 8MB 分块上传、SHA1 去重、symstore.exe 符号索引。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第四，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"SessionManager 用 ThreadPoolExecutor 管理 15 个并发会话\n带 30 分钟空闲超时、后台清理线程、符号预取（创建 session 时后台执行 .reload /f）\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第五，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"output_filter.py 做 CDB prompt 前缀清理、噪音行过滤、终端控制字符（\\r/\\b）模拟。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第六，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从零搭建 REST API（/api/*）、Web 调试页面（/cdb）、Bearer Token 鉴权、YAML 配置。"}]},{"ID":"20260911131515-tqflyiv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260911131515-tqflyiv","updated":"20261004124223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"REST API 是怎么搭建的？"}]},{"ID":"20261004124223-dptk0s9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004124223-dptk0s9","updated":"20261004124223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"REST "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 资源 + 动词语义 + 状态码"}]},{"ID":"20260911131556-ctvcf2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911131556-ctvcf2i","updated":"20260921095717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Starlette 原生路由，没有用 FastAPI 这类高级框架\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"每个接口就是一个 async def 函数，接收 Request 返回 JSONResponse"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n通过"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" Route 注册到路由列表"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，最后在 main.py 里挂到 Starlette app 上"}]},{"ID":"20260911131556-50bbo2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911131556-50bbo2a","updated":"20260921095946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"路由表是一组\nRoute(路径, 端点/处理函数, HTTP 方法列表） 的列表\n比如 Route(\"/api/uploads/create\", endpoint=api_create_upload, methods=[\"POST\"])\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"Starlette 启动时把所有路由注册进去，\n收到请求后根据 URL 路径 + HTTP 方法去匹配路由表"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n找到对应的处理函数执行"}]},{"ID":"20260911131556-bx7vi8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911131556-bx7vi8p","updated":"20260921100013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整个 REST API 层代码很薄\n每个 handler 就是解析参数 → 调 MCP tool 函数 → 包 JSON 返回，业务逻辑全在 tools/core 层\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"MCP tool 和 REST API 共享同一套核心逻辑，改一个地方两边都生效"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260911131725-wq4srlz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260911131725-wq4srlz","updated":"20260911131804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个 REST 请求从进入到返回经历了什么？以 POST /api/uploads/create 为例"}]},{"ID":"20260911131727-js8hd98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911131727-js8hd98","updated":"20260911131804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"路由匹配："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Starlette 遍历路由表，匹配 Route(\"/api/uploads/create\", endpoint=api_create_upload, methods=[\"POST\"])，调 api_create_upload(request)\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"参数解析："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"await request.json() 解析请求体，校验 file_type\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"调业务函数："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"upload_tools.upload(\"dump\") → file_manager.create_upload_token() 生成 UUID + 创建 tmp/{token}/ 目录 + 存内存字典\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"返回响应："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结果经 _api_upload_url() 改写 URL 路径，包装成 JSONResponse 返回"}]},{"ID":"20260911122617-5x6dbfo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260911122617-5x6dbfo","updated":"20260928195948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两个.exe的调用方法"}]},{"ID":"20260911101953-xhx2hs1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911101953-xhx2hs1","updated":"20260921100627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过 Python 的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" subprocess.Popen"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 启动，传入"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" -z "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"参数指定要分析的 dump 文件，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"-y "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"参数指定符号路径。启动之后，调试器进程就一直活着，后续每条调试命令都是通过"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" stdin 管道"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"写进去的，输出从"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" stdout "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"读回来。\n为了保证每次命令的输出不会混在一起，我们用了 UUID 边界标记和完成检测机制，确保结果严格隔离。"}]},{"ID":"20260911101953-c85hhys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911101953-c85hhys","updated":"20260911122617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"symstore.exe 是微软的符号索引工具，用来把 PDB 符号文件注册到本地符号仓库。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n这个不需要交互，直接用 subprocess.run 一次性调用，参数是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" symstore add /f 符号文件路径 /s 符号仓库目录 /t 产品名，执行完就退出。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"另外加了锁机制防止多个上传并发写入导致冲突。"}]},{"ID":"20260911101953-skyplk6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911101953-skyplk6","updated":"20260911122617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总结一下，核心调用方式就是 cdb 走管道交互式长进程，symstore 走一次性同步子进程，都是通过 Python 标准库的 subprocess 模块来启动和管理的。"}]},{"ID":"20260928195948-grqw25w","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260928195948-grqw25w","updated":"20260928195948"}},{"ID":"20260928195547-5eyt9fl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260928195547-5eyt9fl","updated":"20260928221153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目中 AI 是怎么通过请求访问 MCP 工具的？"}]},{"ID":"20260928195602-diz4ee0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260928195602-diz4ee0","updated":"20260928195728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用官方 Python SDK 的 FastMCP 框架，在一个 Starlette 服务里挂了个 /mcp 端点，\n走的是 MCP 的 Streamable HTTP 传输 + JSON-RPC 2.0 协议，没有用 stdio。"}]},{"ID":"20260928195732-4pbey1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260928195732-4pbey1t","updated":"20260928195733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"--"}]},{"ID":"20260928195602-gh3k3hc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260928195602-gh3k3hc","updated":"20260928221153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"流程很简单：\nAI 客户端配置里填一个 URL，\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"先发 initialize 握手拿到 Mcp-Session-Id"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n（\"连接身份证\"，让无状态的 HTTP 请求能关联到同一个 MCP 会话）\n再"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" tools/list "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"把工具的名称、描述、参数 schema 拉下来喂给大模型。\nLLM 决定调哪个工具时，就发一个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" tools/call 的 JSON-RPC 请求过来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n服务端按方法名分发到对应的 Python 函数。"}]},{"ID":"20260928195735-93ayc3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260928195735-93ayc3t","updated":"20260928195811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"--"}]},{"ID":"20260928195602-v5j6p04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260928195602-v5j6p04","updated":"20260928195843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"工具是用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"@mcp.tool() "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"装饰器注册的，\n参数 schema 和描述直接从函数签名和 docstring 自动生成，\n所以改个注释就等于改了给模型看的说明。"}]},{"ID":"20260928195849-tsqpoqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260928195849-tsqpoqa","updated":"20260928195849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"--"}]},{"ID":"20260928195602-5e9bjj1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260928195602-5e9bjj1","updated":"20260928195905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"请求进来会先过 CORS 和 Bearer Token 鉴权中间件，通过后才进 MCP 路由。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"工具内部再往下走线程池和会话池，最终是起一个 cdb.exe 子进程"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n用 stdin/stdout 管道交互——这里有个细节，"}]},{"ID":"20260928195602-bxdx73x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260928195602-bxdx73x","updated":"20260928195921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"另外大文件上传不走 MCP，因为 JSON 塞几百 MB 的 dump 不现实。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"tool_upload 只返回一个带一次性 token 的 URL，AI 自己用 curl PUT"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n（用 HTTP 的 PUT 方法把本地文件的字节流原样上传到服务器）直传，\n控制流走 MCP、数据流走 HTTP，两边分开。\""}]},{"ID":"20260928195944-62m86xc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260928195944-62m86xc","updated":"20260928195944"}},{"ID":"20260911115349-useyr8l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260911115349-useyr8l","updated":"20260929122619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"发起CDB请求怎么做的"}]},{"ID":"20260911115403-8wfv9sq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911115403-8wfv9sq","updated":"20260929115910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采用的是一个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"两步式上传"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的设计\n首先，客户端"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"向服务端请求一个上传凭证"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，服务端会生成一个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"UUID4 随机 token"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，同时"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在本地临时目录下创建一个以这个 token 命名的文件夹，然后把 token 和相关信息存到一个内存字典里"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n返回给客户端一个上传 URL，格式就是 http://服务地址/uploads/{token}。"}]},{"ID":"20260911115403-49rzxs2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911115403-49rzxs2","updated":"20260929113719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二步，\n客户端拿到这个 URL 之后，用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" HTTP PUT 请求把文件流式上传到这个地址"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n服务端收到请求后，通过 URL 里的 token 去字典里查找，\n确认 token 有效、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"类型匹配，然后把文件流式写入到对应临时目录"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n上传完成后，根据类型做后续处理——"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"dump 文件就计算 SHA1 做去重，符号文件就触发 symstore 索引入库"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260911115403-bpgy8b4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911115403-bpgy8b4","updated":"20260929120602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之所以设计成\"先获取 URL、再 PUT 上传\"而不是直接 POST 上传，主要考虑两点：\n一是支持大文件，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"PUT 的请求体就是裸文件字节流，服务端边收边写盘、无需解析 multipart 边界，\n且 URL 已唯一标识目标位置、天然幂等可重传，最适合\"把大文件放进指定临时目录\"这个场景。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n二是解耦，token 本身就是一次性凭证，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"上传完成后立即失效并清理临时目录"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n这样上传接口本身不需要维护状态，安全性也好"}]},{"ID":"20260911115403-jgs38x2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260911115403-jgs38x2","updated":"20260911115403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"简单来说就是：服务端生成一次性 token + 临时目录 → 客户端用这个 token 作为 PUT 目标上传文件 → 服务端校验 token 并处理文件。"}]},{"ID":"20260911121647-thwkq7e","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260911121647-thwkq7e","updated":"20260911121846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"ZGFydA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"# 1. 创建上传凭证\nPOST http://21.214.73.38:8080/api/uploads/create\nHeaders: Authorization: Bearer my-secret-token\nBody: { \"file_type\": \"dump\" }\n\n# 返回：\n{\n  \"upload_url\": \"http://21.214.73.38:8080/api/uploads/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-...\",\n  \"method\": \"PUT\"\n}\n\n# 2. 上传文件\nPUT http://21.214.73.38:8080/api/uploads/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-...?filename=crash.dmp\nHeaders: Authorization: Bearer my-secret-token\nBody: \u003c文件二进制流\u003e\n\n# 返回：\n{ \"status\": \"ok\", \"sha1\": \"abc123...\", \"size_bytes\": 1234567 }\n\n# 3. 查询 dump\nGET http://21.214.73.38:8080/api/dumps/abc123...\n\nPOST：我来创建一个新东西，你给我分配 ID\nPUT：我知道 ID 了，我把东西放到这个 ID 下面\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260929122619-va9lxt1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260929122619-va9lxt1","updated":"20260929122716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"什么是json-rpc"}]},{"ID":"20260929122702-8l7bojr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260929122702-8l7bojr","updated":"20260929122708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"JSON-RPC 是一个很轻量的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"远程调用协议"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n规定了消息的固定格式——请求里带 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"method"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（要调的函数名）、​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"params"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（参数）和 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"id"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（用来配对响应），\n数据本身用 JSON 编码。"}]},{"ID":"20260929122702-hxl5cid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260929122702-hxl5cid","updated":"20260929122702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它只管消息长什么样，​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"不管走什么通道"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，stdio、HTTP、WebSocket 都行。"}]},{"ID":"20260929122702-tt7suhy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260929122702-tt7suhy","updated":"20260929122716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"典型应用就是 MCP：\nIDE 里模型发起工具调用，本质就是发一条 JSON-RPC 请求，\n服务端执行完把结果按同一个 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"id"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 返回——对调用方来说，就像调了一个本地函数。"}]},{"ID":"20260906142210-5ugszy1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260906142210-5ugszy1","updated":"20260921101237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"dump上传怎么做的"}]},{"ID":"20260906142500-g353a7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906142500-g353a7p","updated":"20260911115124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上传用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"Starlette 的流式请求体"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"跑在 Uvicorn/ASGI 上"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\nUvicorn 不攒全 body，而是一块块发 http.request 消息、用 more_body 标记还有没有；\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"Request.stream() "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"把它转成异步生成器逐块 yield。\n我们 async for "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"拿一块写一块盘，8MB 一块、写完就丢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，内存恒定 8MB，4GB 的 dump 也扛得住。"}]},{"ID":"20260906142500-fgpwf28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906142500-fgpwf28","updated":"20260911115155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"对比 request.body()：\n它不是另一套机制，内部就是把 stream 的每块 append 起来再 join，等于帮你攒全，所以才 OOM\n —— 用 stream 就是把控制权拿回自己手里。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260906142500-6rbabor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906142500-6rbabor","updated":"20260921101237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我们额外做了两件事：边读边累加 size，超 4GB 立刻中断、删掉半截文件、返 413；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n以及先落 tmp 临时目录，等 SHA1 校验和归档都成功才 move 进正式仓库，\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"传一半断掉的文件永远污染不了正式目录"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260906142500-1pmw6ob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906142500-1pmw6ob","updated":"20260906142626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"短板是 f.write 和后续的 SHA1 计算都是同步阻塞 IO，\n卡在 async handler 里会拖慢事件循环，理想应该用 aiofiles 或者丢进 executor"}]},{"ID":"20260905222959-hqasfad","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260905222959-hqasfad","updated":"20260921101609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服务都有哪几种预设（快速指令）"}]},{"ID":"20260905223651-to59cld","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0,0,0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"||||","id":"20260905223651-to59cld","updated":"20260905223651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预设"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中文名"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用途"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"执行的 CDB 命令"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"返回结构"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"quick"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"triage"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"快速分诊"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"快速概览：异常 + 调用栈 + TEB（无符号依赖，约 3 秒）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".lastevent"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".exr -1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".ecxr"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"kb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!teb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最后事件、异常记录、调用栈帧列表、TEB 错误码"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"exception"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"info"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"异常详情"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"异常记录 + 上下文 + 调用栈 + 最后错误码"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".exr -1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".ecxr"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"kb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!teb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"异常地址 / 码 / 参数、调用栈帧列表、TEB 错误码"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"thread"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"summary"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程概览"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所有线程的 TEB 状态 + 栈顶帧"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"~*e !teb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"~*kb 1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程列表（每线程含 TID、状态、栈顶符号）及总数"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"module"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"list"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块列表"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"已加载模块列表（结构化）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lm"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块列表（每模块含起止地址、名称、符号状态）"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"heap"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"overview"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"堆概览"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"堆摘要"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!heap -s"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"堆列表（每堆含地址、标志、详情）及原始行数"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"handle"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"summary"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"句柄统计"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"句柄统计"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!handle 0 0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总句柄数、按类型分组的计数字典"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"process"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"info"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进程信息"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进程路径、命令行、工作目录"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!peb"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可执行文件路径、启动命令行、当前工作目录"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"memory"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"summary"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存概览"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虚拟内存摘要：用途 / 类型 / 状态 / 保护 / 最大区域"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"!address -summary"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五张统计表（用途 / 类型 / 状态 / 保护 / 最大区域），每项含区域数、大小、占比"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260913105018-ybzed3r","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260913105018-ybzed3r","updated":"20260921101714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCP的识别效果如何，中间做了哪些优化"}]},{"ID":"20260913105122-qsrn7u1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260913105122-qsrn7u1","updated":"20260913105122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"识别效果不错，AI能准确调用7个工具完成整个dump分析流程。"}]},{"ID":"20260913105122-886uq88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260913105122-886uq88","updated":"20260921101714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一个优化："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"工具描述精确"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"每个tool的docstring把参数含义、返回值、使用场景都写清楚了。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n比如tool_execute_cdb明确说\"一次性执行，启动CDB→跑命令→退出，多步骤分析应该用session\"。\n模型看到描述就知道什么时候该用哪个工具，不用瞎猜。"}]},{"ID":"20260913105122-sb8c2i0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260913105122-sb8c2i0","updated":"20260921101702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二个优化："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"预定义Preset"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n把常用分析封装成结构化预设，比如quick_triage自动执行.lastevent+.excr+kb+!teb，返回结构化JSON\n模型只传名字，不用自己拼命令，也不用从原始文本里手动提取信息。相当于给模型提供了\"标准分析模板\"。"}]},{"ID":"20260913105122-g1w359b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260913105122-g1w359b","updated":"20260921101704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三个优化："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"输出结构化"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\nCDB输出的文本在服务端就用正则解析成dict，异常码、进程名、调用栈帧都提取好了。\n模型拿到的是{\"exception_code\": \"0xC0000005\", \"process_name\": \"app.exe\"}这种结构化数据\n比直接读原始文本识别准确率高很多。"}]},{"ID":"20260913105122-d33gbvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260913105122-d33gbvn","updated":"20260921101705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第四个优化："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"输出过滤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\nCDB加载符号时会输出\"Loading...\"这类噪声，服务端过滤掉再返回，减少token消耗，也让模型更聚焦有效信息。"}]},{"ID":"20260913105122-mltbdtx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260913105122-mltbdtx","updated":"20260921101711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第五个优化："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"自动dump_info"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"create_session时自动跑几个轻量命令收集基本信息（进程、OS、异常时间）\n模型拿到session时已经有上下文了，不用再问\"这是什么dump\"，直接开始分析。"}]},{"ID":"20260914151641-m9kntqz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260914151641-m9kntqz","updated":"20260921102045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结构化输出是怎么做的"}]},{"ID":"20260921101833-rytxvco","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260921101833-rytxvco","updated":"20260921101852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么要做：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"CDB 输出是给人看的控制台文本，直接丢给 AI 既费 token 又被噪声干扰"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n所以我在服务端加了一层结构化输出。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"分净化、解析两层"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260921101833-6nf3yrp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260921101833-6nf3yrp","updated":"20260921101935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"净化层三件事：\n一是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"发命令时前后各插一个带 UUID 的哨兵"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，读取时只切两个哨兵之间的内容，连续跑多条命令也不会串；\n二是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"读线程里逐行模拟终端的 \\r"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为管道模式下 CDB 会把进度行的 \\r 原样保留，不处理就是几万行垃圾；\n三是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"切出来的内容统一去掉行首的 0:049\u0026gt; 提示符和 DBGHELP 符号加载日志"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——\n去提示符是为了让正则匹配得上，去日志是为了省 token。"}]},{"ID":"20260921101833-fxj492d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260921101833-fxj492d","updated":"20260921102015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"解析层是拿到清洗后的文本逐行遍历"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，按每类输出的形态挑工具：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"字段名: 值 这种用 startswith 切前缀；固定格式的用正则抠；\n列数不定的调用栈用分词加启发式（第一个不像十六进制数的当符号）；\n跨行表格和线程分块用 current_section 状态机。最后填进一张字段固定的 dict。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260921101833-ezuiq0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260921101833-ezuiq0k","updated":"20260921102045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最关键的是容错优先：\n字段解析不出来就返回 None，绝不抛异常，同时兼容 x86/x64 地址格式和不同 CDB 版本的字段名差异。\n所以 CDB 升级、输出变形时，只是个别字段为空，不会让整个会话不可用。"}]},{"ID":"20260914163901-ltumibl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260914163901-ltumibl","updated":"20260920130101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人工解dump流程"}]},{"ID":"20260914163908-17rtasb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260914163908-17rtasb","updated":"20260914163941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"先配符号"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，挂上微软符号服务器 .reload /f，符号不全都白搭。\n再看死因，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":".lastevent 加 !analyze -v"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，异常码和可疑模块一般就出来了\n 然后对齐现场，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":".ecxr "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"切到异常那一刻的上下文，不然看的栈是别的线程的\n最后看栈验参数，kb 看调用栈，顺着异常码去 dd、!heap、!locks 这些查具体是哪个参数坏了"}]},{"ID":"20260920130100-pwhwuui","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260920130100-pwhwuui","updated":"20260921102116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"metadata.json（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"元数据"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）是干什么的（问MCP磁盘清理，dump元数据时）"}]},{"ID":"20260920130148-aszgny7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260920130148-aszgny7","updated":"20260920130217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"metadata.json 本质上就是我给每个 dump 建的一本访问账本"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"记每个 dump 的四个信息：上传时间、最后访问时间、访问次数和文件大小"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"key 用 dump 的 SHA1"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260920130148-i4g3gvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260920130148-i4g3gvl","updated":"20260920130655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我做了两个自动清理：\n磁盘水位超了要按 LRU 淘汰，那就"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"按最后访问时间排序，最久没访问的先删"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；\n还有月度过期清理，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"找出超过 N 天没访问的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260920130148-7dfmf5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260920130148-7dfmf5q","updated":"20260920131238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"内存为主、磁盘为辅"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，读写全走内存 dict，磁盘只做持久化；\n二是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"落盘用攒批 + 原子替换"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——因为访问是高频操作，我没让它每次都写盘，\n而是攒够 10 次变更或者 60 秒才批量写一次此外退出时 flush，\n然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用临时文件加 os.replace 保证磁盘上永远是完整文件"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n另外"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"服务启动时我会拿它跟实际 dump 文件双向对账一次"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，保证账本和磁盘状态一致。"}]},{"ID":"20260920131927-992o1x3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260920131927-992o1x3","updated":"20260920132000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"os.replace 原子操作耗时吗"}]},{"ID":"20260920131947-td71vu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260920131947-td71vu4","updated":"20260920132000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 .tmp 和正式文件在同一个目录、同一个文件系统\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"os.replace 底层就是一次 rename——只改目录项、不搬运文件数据"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n所以1KB 和 100MB 一样快，是微秒级的元数据操作。"}]},{"ID":"20260912164227-pnpe1q5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260912164227-pnpe1q5","updated":"20260912164253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AI怎么配这个MCP"}]},{"ID":"20260912164235-gv3ngo3","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260912164235-gv3ngo3","updated":"20260912164253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"anNvbg=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"cdb-analysis\": {\n      \"url\": \"http://21.214.73.38:8080/mcp\",\n      \"headers\": {\n        \"Authorization\": \"Bearer cdb-mcp-1145141919810\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260912164012-dfarxuf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260912164012-dfarxuf","updated":"20260912225005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCP做鉴权了吗"}]},{"ID":"20260912164548-vwry914","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260912164548-vwry914","updated":"20260912164558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自己随便写的，没有自动生成机制\n发者在config.yaml里手写了auth_token: \"cdb-mcp-1145141919810\"，想改就改"}]},{"ID":"20260912164019-4qjqdsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260912164019-4qjqdsh","updated":"20260912164603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"请求头带Authorization: Bearer xxx，服务端中间件拦截所有请求，从header取出token\n用secrets.compare_digest和配置值做时间恒定比较（防时序攻击），不匹配返回401。token为None时跳过认证"}]},{"ID":"20260912164838-cejndli","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260912164838-cejndli","updated":"20260912164847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"防止未授权访问——服务暴露在网络端口上\n任何人能访问就会乱传dump、开CDB会话、耗尽资源\n鉴权确保只有知道token的人（内部团队/自动化脚本）才能使用"}]},{"ID":"20260912225005-6t96elk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260912225005-6t96elk","updated":"20260923220306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"工具是怎么注册的？为什么用 wrapper 模式？"}]},{"ID":"20260912225005-4fr6er2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260912225005-4fr6er2","updated":"20260921102201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我在 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"code text","TextMarkTextContent":"main.py"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 的 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"code text","TextMarkTextContent":"build_app"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 里用 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"code text","TextMarkTextContent":"@mcp.tool()"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 装饰器注册工具"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"但装饰的函数只是个薄包装，函数体就一行\n转发到对应 tools 模块里的真正实现"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n这样做的目的是把 MCP 注册和业务逻辑解耦\n业务函数不依赖 FastMCP 框架，可以单独做单元测试，将来换 MCP 框架或者加 REST 入口，业务代码都不用动"}]},{"ID":"20260923220306-bzx8cfy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260923220306-bzx8cfy","updated":"20260924133925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"符号文件体积大怎么解决"}]},{"ID":"20260923220314-9lql4d8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923220314-9lql4d8","updated":"20260923220601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要靠MCPserver那套符号缓存体系\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"去重 + 隔离："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n符号按 dump 的 sha1 分目录存 user_pdbs，\nSHA1 用 8MB 分块流式计算，同一个 PDB 只存一份，\n重复上传直接复用，上传也是流式落盘，不整块读进内存。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"异步 + 解耦："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nsymstore 索引用后台线程做，类级串行锁保证共享缓存一致、不阻塞命令；\n符号加载用 prefetch_symbols 后台 .reload /f，\n把\"慢的符号加载\"和\"快的命令执行\"拆开。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不重复下载："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\npdb_cache 是共享的公共/微软符号缓存，\n多 dump 复用，所以磁盘清理刻意不淘汰它；\n符号路径按 user_pdbs → pdb_cache → 内网符号服务器 → 微软服务器 排优先级，能命中缓存就不下载。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"磁盘治理："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\ndumps 做 LRU + 超龄清理，\nuser_pdbs 跟着 dump 级联删除，\n还留了 min_retain_count 底线、活跃 session 的 dump 不删。"}]},{"ID":"20260923220603-ijoeu9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923220603-ijoeu9x","updated":"20260923220604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"=========="}]},{"ID":"20260923220604-nksqwsd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923220604-nksqwsd","updated":"20260923220613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"工具客户端这边只把 .pdb/.dll 识别成符号路径，不做解析不解析上传，重活全交给服务端。"}]},{"ID":"20260924133925-h7ccrxj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260924133925-h7ccrxj","updated":"20260924134421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CDB服务为什么要做成MCP而不做成一个Agent"}]},{"ID":"20260924133954-ayr3h1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260924133954-ayr3h1i","updated":"20260924134117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"做的是调试能力"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不是决策流程。\n转储分析里确定性的东西——起 CDB 会话、执行命令、解析输出——应该沉淀成稳定的服务端工具；\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"而'先看什么、再查什么'这种推理编排，交给上层大模型来做才是最灵活的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260924134118-zg3ktd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260924134118-zg3ktd2","updated":"20260924134121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"==============================="}]},{"ID":"20260924134118-ke8xox0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260924134118-ke8xox0","updated":"20260924134403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"做成 MCP，意味着这套能力是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"模型无关、客户端无关的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，Claude、Cursor 或任何 MCP 客户端都能直接接入复用；\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果做成 agent，就把能力层和推理层耦合死了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，模型一升级、流程一改就得动代码。\n一句话总结：我们卖的是锤子，不是抡锤子的手——MCP 让工具被任何'手'调用，这是更正确的分工。"}]},{"ID":"20260924134406-971ojb0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260924134406-971ojb0","updated":"20260924140602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CDB服务如果要做成一个Agent应该怎么做"}]},{"ID":"20260924134423-t8mji0b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260924134423-t8mji0b","updated":"20260924135644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其实就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在现在这套 MCP 工具外面包一层推理循环"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n底层的 CDB 会话管理、命令执行、输出解析全部复用不动，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"它就是 agent 的'手'"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"上面加一个 LLM 作为'脑'，按 ReAct 的方式跑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n——先调 create_session 拿到 dump 基本信息，形成假设，\n比如'像是空指针崩溃'，再决定下一条命令是 !analyze -v 还是 kb，\n拿到输出验证假设，循环迭代直到能下结论，最后生成结构化分析报告。"}]},{"ID":"20260924135649-wh8wkxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260924135649-wh8wkxf","updated":"20260924135651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"==========================="}]},{"ID":"20260924135649-js1sugj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260924135649-js1sugj","updated":"20260924135709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"工程上还要补三件事：\n一是上下文管理，CDB 输出很长，要做摘要和裁剪塞回上下文；\n二是护栏，命令白名单、超时、最大迭代次数，防止它乱执行或死循环；\n三是可观测性，每一步决策和命令都留痕，方便回放调试。"}]},{"ID":"20260924135723-5j1mpj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260924135723-5j1mpj2","updated":"20260924135723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本质上就是：MCP 解决'能力怎么暴露'，agent 解决'能力怎么被自主调用'，两者不是二选一，而是叠起来的关系。"}]},{"ID":"20260924140602-bi2nkla","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260924140602-bi2nkla","updated":"20260928153336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如何写一个skills"}]},{"ID":"20260924140606-hop8mav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260924140606-hop8mav","updated":"20260924140638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我觉得写 Skill 的核心是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"把它当成给 AI 的一份'上岗手册'"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n我会先从具体使用场景出发，想清楚用户会怎么触发它；\n然后写一个 SKILL.md，重点是开头的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"name 和 description"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n因为模型主要靠它们决定什么时候调用这个 Skill，描述里要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"把'做什么'和'何时用'讲清楚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n正文用简洁的祈使句写操作步骤，控制在五千词以内。"}]},{"ID":"20260924140656-q79nvfn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260924140656-q79nvfn","updated":"20260924140658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"========================"}]},{"ID":"20260924140642-wenpnng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260924140642-wenpnng","updated":"20260924140655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"细节用渐进式加载来管理：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"重复执行的逻辑放 scripts/，参考资料放 references/，模板素材放 assets/，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n按需加载，不占上下文。最后拿真实任务跑几轮，哪里卡就迭代哪里，再打包分发"}]},{"ID":"20260924140735-dl50y7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260924140735-dl50y7j","updated":"20260924140736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"========================"}]},{"ID":"20260924140737-cjgf97f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260924140737-cjgf97f","updated":"20260924140737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AI 加载 Skill 是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"渐进式（progressive disclosure）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的，分三层，按需逐级加载："}]},{"ID":"20260924140737-uu8dv5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260924140737-uu8dv5o","updated":"20260924140748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"元数据层（常驻）：\n每个 Skill 的 name + description 始终在上下文里，大约 100 词。\nAI 靠它们做\"触发判断\"——把你的请求和描述语义匹配，决定要不要调用这个 Skill。\n这就像菜单，只有菜名和简介一直摆在桌上。"}]},{"ID":"20260924140737-zf7nkc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260924140737-zf7nkc4","updated":"20260924140757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"SKILL.md 正文（触发时加载）：\n一旦判定要使用，就通过工具调用（比如 use_skill）把整个 SKILL.md 的指令文本读进上下文，\n此时 AI 才\"学会\"具体的工作流程。\n这一层要求控制在 5k 词以内，避免撑爆上下文窗口。"}]},{"ID":"20260924140737-uas9kww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260924140737-uas9kww","updated":"20260924140808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"捆绑资源（按需加载）：\nscripts/、references/、assets/ 里的文件只有在执行到相关步骤时才会被使用\n——脚本可以直接执行而无需读入上下文（省 token），\nreferences 由 AI 自行决定是否读取或 grep 检索，\nassets 则是复制/输出用的素材，根本不进上下文。"}]},{"ID":"20260928153335-tfe5o3j","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260928153335-tfe5o3j","updated":"20261004153620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Streamable HTTP 和 SSE 的区别"}]},{"ID":"20260928153433-i9acrem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260928153433-i9acrem","updated":"20260928153804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"传统 MCP 的 SSE 方案要两个地址：\n一个地址专门建立长连接用来持续收消息；\n另一个普通地址发请求。\n一旦建立长连接，后续所有通信都必须打到同一台服务器，也就是粘性会话，负载均衡不好做。\n网络一断，整个会话直接失效，很难续上。"}]},{"ID":"20260928153806-a3m091c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260928153806-a3m091c","updated":"20260928153807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"==="}]},{"ID":"20260928153804-ikq6g3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260928153804-ikq6g3m","updated":"20260928153830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Streamable HTTP 是 MCP 新版方案，只用一个接口地址。\n发普通请求时就是一次性 HTTP；\n如果需要流式推送，就在这同一个连接上开启 SSE 流。\n会话存在外部共享存储，不绑定在单台机器内存，不用绑定固定服务器，负载均衡更简单；\n网络断开后，客户端可以重新发起请求恢复会话。\n它不是抛弃 SSE，而是把 SSE 流式能力整合进同一个 HTTP 端点。"}]},{"ID":"20261004153620-tds2uxq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261004153620-tds2uxq","updated":"20261004154619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCPserver会话/连接池怎么设计?上限、超时、清理怎么定?"}]},{"ID":"20261004153622-o0tcgzl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004153622-o0tcgzl","updated":"20261004153718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们的会话池管的是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"每个会话一个常驻 CDB 子进程"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这才是稀缺资源。\n上限定 15，\n是按'最坏情况全满也不爆内存'反推的——单会话加载 dump 加符号要几百 MB，\n同时把线程池大小和会话数绑死，保证 15 个会话能真并发不排队。\n满了快速失败，直接报错让调用方自己关旧会话，不做 LRU 淘汰，因为那可能杀掉别人正在用的会话。"}]},{"ID":"20261004153721-7bna3tc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004153721-7bna3tc","updated":"20261004153756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"超时分三层各管一件事：\n单命令 60 秒防 CDB 卡死占死线程，空闲 30 分钟防泄漏\n——短了会杀掉符号刚加载好的会话、重建代价大，\n长了就是白占内存，符号预取单独限 300 秒。"}]},{"ID":"20261004153756-shqa5vf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004153756-shqa5vf","updated":"20261004153824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清理也是三层：\n后台任务每 60 秒扫一次 last_activity 超时的会话踢掉\n（每次执行命令都刷新时间戳，本质是心跳踢人），\n执行前发现 CDB 进程死了立刻回收不等下轮，\n进程退出时 shutdown_all 兜底关掉全部，不留孤儿进程。"}]},{"ID":"20261004154619-q2vat8b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261004154619-q2vat8b","updated":"20261004154735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"连接池管理怎么做的"}]},{"ID":"20261004154627-bwm7p7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004154627-bwm7p7g","updated":"20261004154654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两个类分层负责的。\nCDBSession 管单个子进程\n——subprocess.Popen 拉起 CDB，\n命令前后插 UUID 边界标记、用事件等待实现每命令 60 秒超时，还防连续命令输出串台；\n退出时先发 q 优雅退出、3 秒不行再强杀，初始化超时也自动清理不留半死进程。"}]},{"ID":"20261004154654-wbf4dkn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004154654-wbf4dkn","updated":"20261004154724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"SessionManager 管池\n——15 上限登记、满员快速失败，ThreadPoolExecutor 跑阻塞的 CDB 命令不堵事件循环，\n后台每 60 秒扫空闲超时的会话踢掉，进程退出 shutdown_all 兜底。"}]},{"ID":"20261004154728-ubk7l30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261004154728-ubk7l30","updated":"20261004154735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也就是\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"'单进程的生死和命令超时'在 CDBSession，'N 个进程的并发、上限、清扫'在池层"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\nMCP 框架完全不参与，只做协议路由"}]},{"ID":"20260901152220-d9rcgk4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260901152220-d9rcgk4","updated":"20261003085647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Crash反馈工具"}]},{"ID":"20260923080456-2byjez2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260923080456-2byjez2","updated":"20261003085647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"崩溃一般分为哪几类"}]},{"ID":"20260923080505-k7hqlck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923080505-k7hqlck","updated":"20260923081935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我主要分成四类"}]},{"ID":"20260923080538-5n2bjgk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923080538-5n2bjgk","updated":"20261003085647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一类是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"内存访问相关崩溃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n比如空指针访问、野指针、数组越界、堆内存重复释放，会直接触发访问违例\n第二类是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"异常类崩溃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n比如除零、栈溢出，还有C++里没有捕获的异常，操作系统或者运行时会直接终止进程\n第三类是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"逻辑死锁导致的“假崩溃”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n程序不会直接crash退出，但线程卡死、不再响应，表现和崩溃很像，常见于多线程锁使用不当\n第四类是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"外部触发的崩溃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n比如进程被系统杀死、信号终止、依赖库加载失败，或者硬件、环境问题导致程序异常退出"}]},{"ID":"20260923081056-spgcf61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923081056-spgcf61","updated":"20260923081935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实际排查的时候：\n先抓dump或者日志，先区分是程序主动抛异常还是操作系统触发的访问错误，再定位到对应的类型"}]},{"ID":"20260923083500-rbm5v8r","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260923083500-rbm5v8r","updated":"20261003090722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"崩溃发生时是什么异常？异常被谁捕获？"}]},{"ID":"20260923083510-x0vumqn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923083510-x0vumqn","updated":"20260923084004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"崩溃本质分"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"硬件异常和软件异常"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"硬件异常"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"CPU 执行指令时触发"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，比如访问非法内存、除零，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"CPU 发现错误后，触发中断，陷入内核态"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"软件异常"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"代码主动抛出"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，比如 C++ 未捕获异常，运行时库封装后交给系统。"}]},{"ID":"20260923083510-fb15vnf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923083510-fb15vnf","updated":"20261003090623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"异常首先\n被 CPU 捕获，然后交给操作系统内核"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"内核会查找这个进程注册的异常处理回调"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n如果用户程序接入了 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"Crashpad 这类捕获库"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n提前注册了异常处理器，就会先进入我们的回调函数，在这里抓取 dump。"}]},{"ID":"20260923083510-ep954ky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923083510-ep954ky","updated":"20260923083510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果没有注册自定义处理器，内核就走默认处理逻辑，直接生成系统 dump，然后终止进程。"}]},{"ID":"20260923083510-htm064o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923083510-htm064o","updated":"20261003090722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有个关键点：\n像 SIGKILL 这种信号，不能被进程捕获，\n不会进入用户态回调，也就没法在业务代码里生成 dump。"}]},{"ID":"20260920114251-k72tegs","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260920114251-k72tegs","updated":"20261003091022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"什么是dump文件"}]},{"ID":"20260920114307-ghs7l52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260920114307-ghs7l52","updated":"20261003091022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Dump 文件是程序崩溃时生成的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"进程内存快照"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n它记录了崩溃瞬间所有线程的寄存器上下文、调用栈、加载模块、异常信息以及选定的内存数据，用于事后离线调试。\n我们常用 MiniDump，体积小，可通过 MiniDumpWriteDump 生成；\n配合 PDB 符号文件，就能用 WinDbg 还原现场，定位崩溃根因。"}]},{"ID":"20260923081859-z3552fn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260923081859-z3552fn","updated":"20261003091108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个崩溃发生时，是怎么形成dump文件的"}]},{"ID":"20260923081944-wcb3e7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923081944-wcb3e7h","updated":"20261003091102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Dump 本质就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"进程崩溃瞬间"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"把进程内存、寄存器、线程上下文等现场数据保存成文件"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260923081944-r5ga53c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923081944-r5ga53c","updated":"20261003091108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先\n触发时机：----\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"程序发生未处理异常或者收到崩溃信号"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，操作系统"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"内核"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"会先暂停这个进程所有线程。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"内核收集当前 CPU 寄存器、所有线程栈、虚拟内存页这些现场信息"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260923081944-jrpfz1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923081944-jrpfz1u","updated":"20261003091047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"分两种生成方式----"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n一种是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"系统自动生成"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n比如 Windows 的 WER、Linux 的 core dump，\n内核在进程退出前把收集到的上下文写入 dump/core 文件。\n另一种是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"程序内部捕获信号 / 异常"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n自己调用 API 主动生成 dump，比如 Crashpad，\n在崩溃回调里抓取现场，好处是可以加业务日志，还能控制什么时候才抓 dump。"}]},{"ID":"20260923081944-rt0jro3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923081944-rt0jro3","updated":"20260923082910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生成之后进程才会真正退出。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n要注意，像 Linux OOM 杀进程 SIGKILL 这种，没法捕获，也来不及生成 dump。"}]},{"ID":"20260923084549-dfk3uyy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260923084549-dfk3uyy","updated":"20261003091823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开发时如果想要避免崩溃的出现，有哪些事情可以做？"}]},{"ID":"20260923090822-ddd8tnh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923090822-ddd8tnh","updated":"20260923090852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开发阶段避免崩溃，首先要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"做好编码层面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的防护。\n写 C++ 代码尽量少用裸指针，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"优先智能指针"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"管理内存；\n所有接口"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"入参做判空和合法性校验"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"数组访问注意边界"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，内存申请后判断返回值，\n防止空指针、越界、重复释放这类内存问题。"}]},{"ID":"20260923090856-v7ayq5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923090856-v7ayq5j","updated":"20261003091634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"多线程场景下，\n共享资源合理加锁"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，保证锁配对，避免数据竞争和死锁。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"代码里抛出的异常要按需捕获"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不要让未处理异常直接向上逃逸。"}]},{"ID":"20260923090822-rd9pcr2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923090822-rd9pcr2","updated":"20261003091640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其次\n要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"靠流程手段提前拦截"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n严格执行代码评审，提前发现危险写法；\n编写"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"单元测试、边界用例和并发压力测试"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n覆盖异常场景，把问题在测试阶段暴露出来。"}]},{"ID":"20260923090822-tgkbq2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923090822-tgkbq2v","updated":"20261003091646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同时\n配合各类检测工具。\n编译期开启编译器警告，使用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"静态代码扫描工具"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；\n测试阶段用 ASAN、TSAN 这类"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"运行时检查工具"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n主动捕获内存越界、数据竞争等未定义行为。"}]},{"ID":"20260923090822-3g7ejdx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923090822-3g7ejdx","updated":"20261003091823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当然完全杜绝崩溃很难，所以线上还要接入 Crashpad 收集 dump，\n一旦出现崩溃可以快速定位根因，持续修复。"}]},{"ID":"20260923084553-p4ymebm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260923084553-p4ymebm","updated":"20261003093410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有哪些工具可以帮助我们避免崩溃？"}]},{"ID":"20260923091835-qgn2n1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923091835-qgn2n1k","updated":"20260923091852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"静态检查、运行时检测、运行轨迹采集、崩溃捕获与分析四类工具"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260923091844-9eark9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923091844-9eark9n","updated":"20261003091839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"=="}]},{"ID":"20260923091835-w9ntkzf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923091835-w9ntkzf","updated":"20261003092308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"静态工具不用跑程序，编译阶段扫描代码。\n开启"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"编译器高等级警告"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，还有 CppCheck、Clang Static Analyzer，\n能提前发现空指针、资源泄漏等隐患。"}]},{"ID":"20260923091857-kmhrbpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923091857-kmhrbpk","updated":"20261003091842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"=="}]},{"ID":"20260923091835-cq8y5f6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923091835-cq8y5f6","updated":"20260923091911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"运行时检测工具在测试阶段插桩运行，直接捕获违规行为。\nASAN 查内存越界、野指针、重复释放；\nTSAN 专门检测多线程数据竞争；\nValgrind 排查内存错误，在测试阶段就把会引发崩溃的问题揪出来。"}]},{"ID":"20260923091912-k29hrvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923091912-k29hrvw","updated":"20261003091846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"=="}]},{"ID":"20260923091835-6mmwypd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923091835-6mmwypd","updated":"20260923091918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有 Windows 的 ETW 配套工具，像 WPR、PerfView。\n它不插桩，开销低，采集进程、异常、线程调度事件。\n遇到偶现崩溃，可以通过 etl 日志回溯崩溃前的执行路径，定位难以复现的问题。"}]},{"ID":"20260923091926-7jmkb7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923091926-7jmkb7t","updated":"20261003091850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"=="}]},{"ID":"20260923091835-mvkmwax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260923091835-mvkmwax","updated":"20260923091933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"崩溃捕获与分析工具：Crashpad 负责崩溃发生时抓取 dump 文件；\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"WinDbg 用来解析 dump，查看崩溃时的调用栈、寄存器、内存现场，定位崩溃根因"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，修复问题防止再次出现。"}]},{"ID":"20260916225905-lok861f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916225905-lok861f","updated":"20260916225906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260916225906-sgj6ihz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260921104509-clodjgx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260921104509-clodjgx","updated":"20260921104509"}},{"ID":"20260916222634-z49lom3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260916222634-z49lom3","updated":"20261003094136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"crash分析工具是MVC架构还是MVVM架构"}]},{"ID":"20260916223301-9e8pc38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916223301-9e8pc38","updated":"20261003093410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Crash 分析这部分我是按"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" View / ViewModel / Model "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三层来落的"}]},{"ID":"20260916223301-hx8gfbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916223301-hx8gfbq","updated":"20261003094136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"View 就是 CrashAnalysisWindow"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一个有状态组件\n有状态组件才有初始化和销毁这些生命周期\n——它"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"靠在 initState 里 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11); background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"addListener 订阅 ViewModel"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11); background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n它只做三件事：\n文件选择和拖拽、按钮与状态的展示、分析结果的渲染"}]},{"ID":"20260916223301-970gkp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916223301-970gkp9","updated":"20261003093410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"ViewModel 就是 CrashAnalysisManager"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，它继承 ChangeNotifier\n它"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"持有整条链路的全部状态"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——状态机、进度文案、分析结果、错误信息、归档 id\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"并且把这些状态只以只读 getter 的形式暴露给 UI"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"同时内部负责"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"配置加载、预筛、深度分析、超时、归档"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这些流程编排"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。UI 只能读，不能直接改。"}]},{"ID":"20260916223301-9oe6c3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916223301-9oe6c3y","updated":"20261003093410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4); background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"绑定方式是："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4); background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"\nView 在 initState 里订阅manager\nmanager 内部状态一变就 notifyListeners()\nView 的回调里做一次 setState 触发重建"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260916223301-dlysnzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916223301-dlysnzp","updated":"20261003093410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"Model 层是 analysis/ 和 archive/ 那一堆"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n输入归一化、MCP 桥接、深度采证、规则归因、内存/CPU 专项、归档上报\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"ViewModel 只把它们编排起来，不关心 HTTP、命令细节和规则实现"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260921104458-sjdcyps","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260921104458-sjdcyps","updated":"20261003093410"}},{"ID":"20260916222645-41abayu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260916222645-41abayu","updated":"20261003100722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"crash工具用了哪些设计模式和设计原则"}]},{"ID":"20260916224545-9eimu9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916224545-9eimu9v","updated":"20261003093410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"观察者"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是最核心的一个——CrashAnalysisManager 继承 ChangeNotifier（状态容器 + 通知器）\nUI 层用 addListener 订阅，状态一变就自动刷新。"}]},{"ID":"20260916224545-9b3f23w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916224545-9b3f23w","updated":"20261003093410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"门面模式"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——Manager 对 UI 只暴露 status、progressText、localMultiResult、errorMsg 这几个只读入口\nUI 完全不需要知道底下有扫描、预筛、MCP 桥接、规则引擎这些东西\n（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"封装一堆复杂子系统的调用顺序，对外只暴露一个简单入口，客户端不用关心内部一堆细节"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"}]},{"ID":"20260916224545-5z4sw4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916224545-5z4sw4m","updated":"20261003093410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桥接模式"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——CrashMcpBridge 把 MCP 的 HTTP 调用整个封住，业务层只看到方法调用；外部到底是 HTTP 服务还是 CLI 子进程，上层不关心，换后端不影响业务代码。\n（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"业务抽象和底层通信实现通过 transport 接口搭了一座桥两个维度独立变化互不绑定"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"}]},{"ID":"20260916224545-d22y2hn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916224545-d22y2hn","updated":"20261003093410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"策略模式"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——深度分析有\"本地规则\"和\"CLI/LLM\"两条策略，由 useLocalDeep 决定走哪条，当前生产走本地规则那条。"}]},{"ID":"20260916224545-b9tw92s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916224545-b9tw92s","updated":"20261003093410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"模板方法 / 管道编排"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——预筛到深度分析是一条固定骨架：\n解压扫描 → 预筛 → 分组 → 采证 → 归因 → 汇总 → finally 关 session，具体分支留给策略决定，骨架不变"}]},{"ID":"20260916224545-sfbax67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916224545-sfbax67","updated":"20261003093410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"单例"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——AppConfigLoader.instance 和 AnalysisArchiveService.instance，跨窗口共享配置和网络客户端。"}]},{"ID":"20260916224545-2q660et","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916224545-2q660et","updated":"20261003093410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"另外规则引擎本身是一条按优先级排列的决策链，命中即返回、不命中就交给下一层，思路接近责任链。"}]},{"ID":"20260916224545-lc8urfm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916224545-lc8urfm","updated":"20261003093410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"设计原则上最突出三条：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"单一职责"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，每个文件只干一件事——bridge 只管 HTTP、采证器只负责采证、规则引擎只负责归因；\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"开闭原则"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，新增一种 crash 类型只要加一个专项分析器再在配置里配规则，不用改主流程；\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"依赖倒置"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，bridge、Dio、进程启动器都做成可注入的，所以网络、进程、文件系统这些外部依赖在测试里都能替换掉。"}]},{"ID":"20261003100722-k6relqu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20261003100722-k6relqu","updated":"20261003100722"}},{"ID":"20261003100713-i5p0uo6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20261003100713-i5p0uo6","updated":"20261003100713"}},{"ID":"20260904214700-lw0no2w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260904214700-lw0no2w","updated":"20261003100753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color1);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"整体"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color1);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"概览（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"非详细分析，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"让整体介绍项目的时候发"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）========="}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-0j4a5wr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-0j4a5wr","updated":"20260904221655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Crash 分析规则引擎，整体可以概括成一条流水线：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"输入扫描与预筛、Crash 分组、代表样本深度采证、按优先级执行规则、专项分析、结果汇总和 UI 展示。"}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-l5nra0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-l5nra0j","updated":"20260917144536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"输入准备"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n用户选择单个 dump，也可以选择 zip 包或混合输入，系统会"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"先统一输入格式"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n在后台 Isolate 中解压，避免阻塞 UI，同时做 Zip Slip 路径校验\n随后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"扫描 dump 文件，跳过 caton_dump 这类卡顿目录，并通过 SHA-1 去重"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n对候选 dump 先执行 quick_triage，提取异常码、故障桶、栈信息和模块信息，完成一次"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"轻量级预筛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"最多保留5个Crash 样本"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，减少后续 CDB 深度分析的开销"}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-3ayhhev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-3ayhhev","updated":"20261003100747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Crash 签名进行分组"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n签名主要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color4);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"由异常码、故障地址、故障模块和关键栈信息等"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color4);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内容共同决定，\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"相同或高度相似的 Crash 会归到同一组"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n每组只选择一个代表 dump 做深度采证，这样既能避免重复分析，也能保留批量 Crash 的整体分布\n深度采证层通过REST API调用 CDB，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"依次获取异常信息、模块列表、内存摘要、异常上下文和调用栈，随后执行 !analyze -v"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n栈帧获取还有多级降级策略：优先使用结构化结果，如果结构化结果缺失，就依次使用过滤后的栈、预筛阶段的栈\n（已删除）：最后再解析原始 kb 文本，保证部分命令失败时流程仍然可以继续"}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-wvbgung","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-wvbgung","updated":"20261003100753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"规则引擎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"采用“先命中、先返回”的短路逻辑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"最前面的规则负责识别确定性更高、影响更大的问题："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"例如异常码缺失、堆损坏、函数指针异常、硬件故障桶、进程主动退出、Crashpad 主动上报、\nCEF 环境异常，以及磁盘、DLP、杀毒软件导致的 磁盘/文件读不出来。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"针对 Intel 13/14 代CPU，还会单独检查控制流失控、IP_ON_HEAP、特权指令异常等 CPU 缺陷信号。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n这样做的目的是先排除硬件、环境和进程主动退出等特殊情况，避免后面的模块归因覆盖掉更准确的结论。"}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-mniqktg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-mniqktg","updated":"20261003095811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果前面的专项规则没有命中，系统会进入栈和模块归因阶段。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n首先会过滤系统透明模块、去除递归重复帧，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"构造用户态调用栈"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n如果没"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有有效用户帧，还会检查栈溢出、Hook、IAT 损坏或未知注入模块"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n然后优先检查栈顶用户帧：如果栈顶模块属于第三方厂商名册，\n就直接认为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第三方模块是高优先级嫌疑对象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n如果栈顶没有命中，再扫描前 20 个用户帧寻找第三方模块\n配置中的第三方厂商、企微自身 DLL、系统透明模块以及场景关键词都来自 config.json 的 crash_knowledge 配置\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"规则本身和业务数据是分离的，后续维护厂商名册时不需要大规模修改代码"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-md598hl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-md598hl","updated":"20260921104327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三方判断并不是简单地“栈里出现过就归因”"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n引擎还会"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"结合异常码、"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"场景关键词"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"、模块加载情况和模块出现位置进行交叉判断"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n比如栈顶是未知模块时，会优先保留未知模块结论，避免深层的已知第三方模块误导归因；\n如果第三方模块和未知模块交替穿插，也会降低置信度或标记为复杂注入场景\n未知模块则会按照出现频次排序，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"默认提取 Top 3 作为重点嫌疑模块"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n如果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"确认是第三方模块但缺少 DLL 路径"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，编排器"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"会额外执行 lmvm 补查模块路径"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-background-color, #554b00); color: var(--b3-inline-style-20260913200246-2dyiham-color, #ffffff);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n再把补充后的证据重新送回规则引擎进行二次归因"}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-cbgcrs3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-cbgcrs3","updated":"20260905151513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"如果没有第三方或未知模块命中，最后才判断是否属于企微自身模块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n企微模块命中时，会结合调用栈连续性、异常类型以及是否存在内存破坏来评估可信度\n因为一旦发生堆损坏或栈损坏，调用栈本身可能已经不可靠，所以不能仅凭最后一帧就断言是企微自身问题\n整个规则链最后还有 R8 兜底规则，无法确定责任模块时统一归类为未知模块或无法分析\n并保留现有证据，而不是强行给出一个看似确定但实际不可靠的结论"}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-9qqgiqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-9qqgiqc","updated":"20260921104443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"内存问题和 CPU 问题属于跨 dump 的专项分析"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"内存分析器会扫描日志中的 [Memory]、VirtualAvaliable、[sys] 和 [MemoryInspector] 等信息"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n如果日志证据不完整，也会结合 dump 中的硬证据进行判断\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"CPU 缺陷分析则先确认是否为 Intel 13/14 代CPU\n再综合观察 Crash 是否分散发生、地址 bit31 是否翻转、寄存器中的小整数是否异常翻转，以及数据库损坏次数\n崩溃分散度、地址翻转和数据库损坏属于强信号，可以直接或高权重支持 CPU 缺陷结论"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"CRT 或普通堆损坏属于弱信号，通常需要和其他证据叠加，避免误判"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260904214657-bpn9ay1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260904214657-bpn9ay1","updated":"20260917145409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"最后"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n编排器会把每个 Crash 组的分类、置信度、责任厂商、关联场景、证据链、客服话术、第三方模块、未知模块和耗时"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"封装成 LocalAnalysisResult"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"再通过 GroupSummary 做跨组汇总"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n对于明确的 OOM，系统还可以提前终止后续分组分析，并把未处理的分组标记为 oom_batch_skipped\n结果经过统一分类枚举和置信度钳位后，由 CrashAnalysisManager 更新状态、处理超时取消和归档，最后由 crash_analysis_window 监听状态并展示总体结论、分组结果、内存分析和模块证据"}]},{"ID":"20261003100719-02v6sru","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20261003100719-02v6sru","updated":"20261003100719"}},{"ID":"20260921104522-ma5nxht","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260921104522-ma5nxht","updated":"20260921104522"}},{"ID":"20260905230216-ztuhlk7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260905230216-ztuhlk7","updated":"20260918112333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"深度采证结构体"}]},{"ID":"20260905230331-z6mhnjr","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260905230331-z6mhnjr","updated":"20260905230533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"ZGFydA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"class DeepCollectionResult {\n  // ===== 基本标识 =====\n  final String dumpSha1;              // dump 文件 SHA1 指纹\n  final String dumpFilePath;          // dump 本地路径\n  final int elapsedMs;                // 深度采证总耗时(ms)\n\n  // ===== 异常信息（来自 exception_info preset + 降级） =====\n  final String? exceptionCode;        // 异常码，如 0xc0000005\n  final String? exceptionAddress;     // 异常指令地址\n  final String? exceptionModule;      // 异常模块名（三级降级推断：!analyze→栈顶→null）\n  final String? exceptionDescription; // 异常描述文本\n  final DateTime? dumpTime;           // dump 生成时间\n\n  // ===== 调用栈（四级降级策略） =====\n  final List\u003cStackFrame\u003e stackFrames; // 栈帧列表，每帧含：\n                                      //   frameIndex, moduleName, functionName,\n                                      //   fullSymbol, framePointer, returnAddress\n\n  // ===== 模块列表（来自 module_list preset） =====\n  final List\u003cLoadedModule\u003e loadedModules; // 已加载模块，每模块含：\n                                          //   name(去后缀), fullName, path,\n                                          //   startAddress, endAddress, version, companyName\n\n  // ===== !analyze -v 解析字段 =====\n  final String? faultingModule;       // !analyze 归因的故障模块名\n  final String? failureBucketId;      // 崩溃桶 ID\n  final String? analyzeVOutput;       // !analyze -v 原始文本\n\n  // ===== 其他证据 =====\n  final String? crashRegistersRaw;    // .ecxr; kb 原始文本（CPU 位翻转判定用）\n  final Map\u003cString, dynamic\u003e? memorySummary; // !address -summary 结果（内存概览）\n  final String? lastStatusValue;      // LAST_STATUS_VALUE（如 0xc000012d = 系统级 OOM 硬证据）\n  final int? lastError;               // LAST_ERROR_CODE（Win32 错误码十进制）\n\n  // ===== 执行状态 =====\n  final bool allCommandsSucceeded;    // 所有 CDB 命令是否执行成功\n  final List\u003cString\u003e failedCommands;  // 失败的命令列表\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260918112333-fvbnzot","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260918112333-fvbnzot","updated":"20261003100841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基于输入到输出，做了哪些技术实现 ("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"分析流程简易版"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"}]},{"ID":"20260918112427-hp0kft7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260918112427-hp0kft7","updated":"20260918112427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我做的技术实现，按流水线分五步："}]},{"ID":"20260918112427-8vxdlci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260918112427-8vxdlci","updated":"20260918112639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一，输入归一化："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n用 SHA-1 指纹命名解压目录，在后台 isolate 解压避免卡 UI\n递归扫描目录树（含嵌套 zip、MDMP 魔数识别），统一成 dump 列表并本地去重"}]},{"ID":"20260918112427-qy7txkn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260918112427-qy7txkn","updated":"20260918112654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二，dump预筛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n把每个 dump 上传 CDB MCP 服务、建 session、跑 quick_triage\n用 Future.any 滑动窗口并发 2 调度，过滤掉非崩溃和重复的，最多留 5 个候选\n入选的 session 所有权转交后续深度阶段，其余当场关闭"}]},{"ID":"20260918112427-39wwvsc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260918112427-39wwvsc","updated":"20260918112720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第三，分组 + 深度采证"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n按\"异常码 + 模块 + 函数\"签名做 L1/L2 分组，相同崩溃只取代表 dump 采证\n采证层执行 exception_info、module_list、.ecxr;kb、!analyze -v\n命令分批隔离、四级栈帧降级，再用 lmvm 补 DLL 路径、!cpuid 采 CPU 型号"}]},{"ID":"20260918112427-wd7qm0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260918112427-wd7qm0c","updated":"20260918112607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第四，确定性规则归因"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\nS0~S5 + R8 先命中先返回的管道，先做异常码分流（硬件桶、主动退出、CEF 环境异常、I/O 错误）\n再过透明模块过滤构建用户栈，然后栈顶/前置帧命中第三方、场景关联印证、企微自身判定、未知模块兜底\n配合内存破坏模式和置信度钳位控制误判"}]},{"ID":"20260918112427-77vhgpd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260918112427-77vhgpd","updated":"20260918112550"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第五，专项修正 + 归档"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n内存专项从企微日志反查（两阶段扫描 + 10 条规则链）区分系统 OOM 和企微 OOM\nCPU 专项用 Raptor Lake 强弱信号和覆盖矩阵做受约束修正\n最后结果写本地 JSONL 并异步上报统计后台"}]},{"ID":"20260918112427-geiomuw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260918112427-geiomuw","updated":"20260918112626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"最终结果是 MultiDumpAnalysisResult"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-background-color, var(--b3-card-info-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-info-color, var(--b3-card-info-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n每个分组的分类、置信度、技术证据、客服话术，加上影响范围和总体结论"}]},{"ID":"20261003100841-lmeb87k","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20261003100841-lmeb87k","updated":"20261003100841"}},{"ID":"20261003100837-6yy2x76","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20261003100837-6yy2x76","updated":"20261003100837"}},{"ID":"20260904214708-8mf22yl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260904214708-8mf22yl","updated":"20261003111739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"规则引擎详细"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"详细分析部分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）（下面新的几条内存、CPU等有详细描述，说到那的时候发）"}]},{"ID":"20260929214917-mwpmjqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260929214917-mwpmjqv","upda